  - m_Id: 2630370347180049
    m_Localized: Meadow Wolf
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180050
    m_Localized: Slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180054
    m_Localized: Iron Golem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180063
    m_Localized: Obsidian Golem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180065
    m_Localized: A normal battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180066
    m_Localized: Turn gauges fill twice as fast!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180067
    m_Localized: Reduced accuracy for all combatants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180068
    m_Localized: All units heal a little each round.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180069
    m_Localized: Damage dealt and received is doubled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180070
    m_Localized: Sunny Fields
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180071
    m_Localized: A gentle breeze sweeps through the golden grass. A perfect place
      to begin your journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180072
    m_Localized: Flower Garden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180073
    m_Localized: Colourful flowers hide small but persistent pests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180074
    m_Localized: Rolling Hills
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180075
    m_Localized: Speed is everything on open ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180076
    m_Localized: Wind Prairie
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180077
    m_Localized: The Giant Slime patrols these plains. It hits harder than it looks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180078
    m_Localized: "Peaceful Pasture \u2014 Boss"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180079
    m_Localized: '[BOSS] The Meadow Wolf guards the path to the forest. Defeat it
      to move on.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180080
    m_Localized: Whispering Woods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180081
    m_Localized: The trees close in. Strange sounds echo from the canopy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180082
    m_Localized: Dark Grove
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180083
    m_Localized: Poison Frogs lurk beneath the undergrowth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180084
    m_Localized: Ancient Forest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180085
    m_Localized: The howling grows louder. Wolves hunt in packs here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180086
    m_Localized: Twilight Glade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180087
    m_Localized: A Great Owl watches from above. The Treant stirs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180088
    m_Localized: "Mossy Hollow \u2014 Boss"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180089
    m_Localized: '[BOSS] The Ancient Wolf rules this forest. Its pack defends it
      fiercely.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180090
    m_Localized: Crystal Cavern
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180091
    m_Localized: The crystals glow faintly. Bats dive from the ceiling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180092
    m_Localized: Shadow Depths
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180093
    m_Localized: Dark Spiders spin webs across every passage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180094
    m_Localized: Echo Chamber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180095
    m_Localized: The Stone Golem barely moves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180096
    m_Localized: Underground Lake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180097
    m_Localized: Something fast moves in the shadows. Don't let it reach your back
      line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180098
    m_Localized: "Stalactite Hall \u2014 Boss"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180099
    m_Localized: '[BOSS] The Cave Troll fills the entire chamber. Tanky AND aggressive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180100
    m_Localized: Rocky Peak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180101
    m_Localized: Rock Hounds patrol the lower paths. Stronger than forest wolves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180102
    m_Localized: Eagle's Nest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180103
    m_Localized: Harpies and Thunder Eagles dive from the peaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180104
    m_Localized: Stone Giant Pass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180105
    m_Localized: Armored Bears and Iron Golems block the mountain pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180106
    m_Localized: Cloud Ridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180107
    m_Localized: A Frost Drake circles overhead. The elite Thunder Eagles escort
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180108
    m_Localized: "Frozen Summit \u2014 Boss"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180109
    m_Localized: '[BOSS] The Mountain King commands peak and storm alike. Nothing
      survives up here.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180110
    m_Localized: Lava Fields
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180111
    m_Localized: The ground burns. Lava Salamanders are the least of your worries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180112
    m_Localized: Ashen Caldera
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180113
    m_Localized: Fire Imps move faster than anything you've faced. They hit twice
      before you blink.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180114
    m_Localized: Obsidian Peak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180115
    m_Localized: Obsidian Golems and Hellhounds. One won't die; the other will kill
      you first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180116
    m_Localized: Fire Basin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180117
    m_Localized: The Volcanic Drake and its elite guard. The last test before the
      Dragon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180118
    m_Localized: "Magma Core \u2014 Final Boss"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2630370347180119
    m_Localized: "[FINAL BOSS] The Inferno Dragon. Absolute peak threat. Bring your
      best animals \u2014 fully fed and petted."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
